      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Excellently presented three bedroom semi detached house looking onto a large green area. This property is in turnkey condition."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "This property consists of entrance hall, livingroom, sittingroom, kitchen/diningroom and guest wc on the ground floor. Upstairs comprises of three bedrooms – master en suite and bathroom."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Entrance hall -  18'   x  5' 9\" \r\nTimber flooring/double doors to sittingroom\r\n\r\nSittingroom -  16'   x  11' 9\" \r\nFireplace/timber flooring/bay window\n\n\r\n\r\nLivingroom -  12'   x  9'  \r\nFrench doors to patio area/timber flooring\r\n\r\nKitchen/diningroom -  17' 9\"  x  10'  \r\nFitted kitchen – integrated oven & hob/tiled floor\r\n\r\nGuest wc -  7' 7\"  x  3' 1\" \r\nTiled floor\r\n\r\nStairs & landing - \r\nCarpet on stairs & timber landing\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 -  12'   x  11' 9\" \r\nBuilt in wardrobes/timber flooring\nEn suite                                                                                                     8’7’’ x 3’1’’\nFloor and shower area tiled\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 -  12' 9\"  x  11' 4\" \r\nTimber flooring\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 -  8' 3\"  x  8'  \r\nTimber flooring\r\n\r\nBathroom - 8.0m x 6.0m \r\n\r\n\r\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Hotpress\r\n\r\nGas Fired Central Heating/new boiler/pipework & radiators throughout\r\n\r\nNew PVC triple glazed window & doors throughout\r\n\r\nCavity pumped/attic insulated\r\n\r\nGarden front & rear – garden shed.\r\n\r\nTimber decking to the rear of the property\r\n\r\nMains water/mains sewer.\r\n\r\nWired for alarm/security cameras\r\n\r\nDriveway – ample parking space\r\n\r\nSide gate/outside tap\r\n\r\nLow maintenance exterior\r\n\r\nWithin walking distance of Mallow town centre/shops/schools/etc…\r\n\r\nEasy access to Cork/Limerick Road (N20)\r\n\r\nIdeal family home"
